---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "English, learned by doing"
description: "Palm River Academy is an English language center in Hội An for children from 20 months to 18. We teach English through science, maths, cooking, art and sport, in classes of 13 or fewer."
---
{% import "macros/icons.njk" as ic %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__bg" style="--focus: 28% 30%">{% photo "hero-cooking-class-hoi-an", "", "100vw", true %}</div>
  {% set frondClass = "frond--tr" %}{% include "partials/frond.njk" %}
  {% set frondClass = "frond--bl" %}{% include "partials/frond.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap hero__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--on rise" style="--d:0">English Language Center · Hội An</p>
    <h1 class="rise" style="--d:1">English, learned <span class="mark">by doing.</span></h1>
    <p class="lede rise" style="--d:2">English, taught through science, maths, cooking, art and sport. For children from 20 months to 18 years.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions rise" style="--d:3">
      <a class="btn btn--white" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Book a tour</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost-white" href="{{ '/learning/' | url }}">Our programs</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class="hero__facts" aria-label="At a glance">
    <li class="leafpill">20 months to 18 years</li>
    <li class="leafpill">Small classes</li>
    <li class="leafpill">Since {{ site.founded }}</li>
  </ul>
  {% include "partials/river.njk" %}
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Our story</p>
      <h2>Serving families in Hội An and Đà Nẵng since {{ site.founded }}</h2>
      <p class="lede lede--blue">Hội An's oldest international learning center.</p>
      <p>We opened in {{ site.founded }} for families who wanted their children to learn English without sitting still all day. That is still the idea. Half our families are Vietnamese and half are from abroad. So are our teachers.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">About us</a>
    </div>
    <div class="leaf-wrap leaf-wrap--r has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--sun sticker--tl">Est. {{ site.founded }}</span>
      {% photo "community-at-campus-wall", "photo--lg photo--tilt-r" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "navy" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--navy film">
  {% set frondClass = "frond--tr" %}{% include "partials/frond.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap film__grid">
    <div class="film__text">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--on">Made by students</p>
      <h2>The 2025-26 yearbook, as a film</h2>
      <p class="lede">Our Upper Secondary yearbook team photographed, designed and edited the whole year. This is their three-minute cut.</p>
      <p class="film__meta">3 min · with sound · every class, from Nursery to Upper Secondary</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="film__player">
      <span class="sticker sticker--sun sticker--tl">Student made</span>
      <video class="film__video" controls preload="none" playsinline
        poster="{{ '/assets/video/yearbook-2025-26-poster.webp' | url }}"
        src="{{ '/assets/video/yearbook-2025-26.mp4' | url }}"
        aria-label="Palm River Academy yearbook 2025-26, a film by the student yearbook team"></video>
      <button class="film__play" type="button" aria-label="Play the yearbook film">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
      </button>
      <figcaption class="film__caption">Yearbook 2025-26 · Palm River Academy students</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<div class="ribbons" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="mascot" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50 95 C 20 70, 10 35, 50 5 C 90 35, 80 70, 50 95 Z" fill="var(--green-light)"/><path d="M50 12 L50 90" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" opacity=".6"/><g class="mascot__eyes"><circle class="eye" cx="42" cy="40" r="7"/><circle class="eye" cx="58" cy="40" r="7"/><circle class="pupil" cx="43" cy="41" r="3"/><circle class="pupil" cx="59" cy="41" r="3"/></g></svg>
  <div class="ribbon ribbon--green">
    <div class="ribbon__track ribbon__track--rev">
      {% for i in [1, 2] %}<span>Science</span><span>Maths</span><span>Cooking</span><span>Art</span><span>Sport</span><span>Technology</span><span>Public speaking</span><span>Maker Space</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ribbon ribbon--blue">
    <div class="ribbon__track">
      {% for i in [1, 2] %}<span>Intellectual Exploration</span><span>Creative Expression</span><span>Sports and Fun</span><span>Community Impact</span><span>Global Citizenship</span><span>Leadership</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we teach English</p>
      <h2>Content through context</h2>
      <p class="lede">Nobody learns a language from a worksheet. Children learn English because they need it to measure the flour, explain the experiment and argue about the rules.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="method">
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("flask", "blue") }}<strong>Real subjects, in English</strong><p>Cambridge English, Maths and Science every morning, with qualified teachers.</p></div>
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("whisk", "green") }}<strong>Doing, not drilling</strong><p>Every afternoon is hands-on: cooking, crafts, art, technology, sport.</p></div>
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("chat", "sun") }}<strong>Small enough to talk</strong><p>{{ site.classCap }} or fewer per class, so every child gets to speak.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Academics</p>
      <h2>From 20 months to 18 years</h2>
      <p class="lede">Pick your child's stage.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tiles mt">
      {% for p in programs %}{% if p.key != 'global' %}
      <a class="tile tile--{{ p.tone }}" href="{{ p.url | url }}">
        {% photo p.photo, "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 46vw" %}
        <span class="tile__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
        <span class="tile__label"><strong>{{ p.name }}</strong><small>{{ p.ages }}</small></span>
      </a>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "blue" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--blue">
  <div class="wrap stats">
    <div class="stat"><p class="stat__num" data-count="{{ site.classCap }}">{{ site.classCap }}</p><h3>Children per class, at most</h3><p>In every academic class.</p></div>
    <div class="stat"><p class="stat__num" data-count="{{ ('' | year) - site.founded }}">{{ ('' | year) - site.founded }}</p><h3>Years in Hội An</h3><p>Serving families in Hội An and Đà Nẵng since {{ site.founded }}.</p></div>
    <div class="stat"><p class="stat__num" data-count="10">10+</p><h3>Alumni abroad</h3><p>At high schools and universities overseas.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two two--flip">
    <div class="leaf-wrap has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--violet sticker--br">3 weeks to 3 months</span>
      {% photo "global-program-nature-walk", "photo--lg photo--tilt" %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--violet">Visiting Hội An?</p>
      <h2>The Global Program</h2>
      <p>Here for a few weeks or a season? Your child joins a real class for three weeks to three months, half day or full day, ages 2 to 14.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--green" href="{{ '/learning/global-program/' | url }}">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale-green" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale-green">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Campus life</p>
      <h2>Lanterns, cupcakes and chess</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="gallery mt">
      {% photo "gallery-lantern-workshop", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-magnetic-tiles", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-cupcake-decorating", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-chess-library", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-twister-game", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-mural-printing", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-water-play", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-reading-corner", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
    </div>
    <p class="gallery__hint" hidden>Tap a photo to see it bigger.</p>
    <p class="center mt"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/events/' | url }}">A year of events</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div class="leaf-wrap leaf-wrap--tint has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--green sticker--tr">5 min from the old town</span>
      {% photo site.campus.photo, "photo--lg photo--wide" %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Where we are</p>
      <h2>One campus in Cẩm Thanh</h2>
      <p>A few minutes from Hội An's old town. Every age learns on the same site.</p>
      <p><strong>{{ site.campus.address }}</strong><br>{{ site.hours }}</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.campus.mapUrl }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Open in Google Maps</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "blue" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
